      "lineage": {
        "description": "HDX Signals is an automated monitoring system that ingests multiple humanitarian and disaster-related datasets (ACLED, IDMC, IPC, JRC, WFP, WHO, ACAPS INFORM) and applies statistical anomaly detection algorithms to identify significant negative changes in key indicators. The system generates alert signals when changes exceed defined thresholds, aggregating multi-source impact data at location and temporal scales to support early warning and situational awareness.",
